     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Ah OK, was just looking at the number/ID of the MLGs and saw that the last one still said 82 when it had been contracted to 55 mlgs, but when I tried using the length() function I realized it was indeed correct and I had just not noticed that certain numbers where being skipped in the list.... guess I am tired! Feel free to delete the post haha Thanks! </div></div>"
